[Cheats/Enable Debug Menu Hold Select button at Dolby Logo screen X to accept or toggle an option.D-Pad Left / Right to change an option. Select to enable scrolling of the top menu bar.Triangle to start the game normally.Menu Option Level Changes the level category.SubLev	Changes the sub level.Position Spawns you in different locations.Camera Number Display Displays debug information on-screen while in-game.Widescreen ModeToggles widescreen mode.Slow Motion  has no effect on the PS2 version.Disable Hell Doors Display Blood Effects	Turns blood on or off]
